config MTK_SENSORHUB
	tristate "MediaTek SCP sensor hub (IPI_SENSOR client and IIO front end)"
	depends on MTK_SCP
	depends on IIO
	help
	  Say yes here to expose the sensors behind MediaTek's SCP sensor hub as
	  IIO devices. The hub speaks MediaTek's own protocol over the SCP's
	  IPI id 8: control messages travel through the interrupt and the samples
	  themselves through a ring buffer in DRAM.

config MTK_SENSORHUB_KUNIT_TEST
	tristate "KUnit tests for the SCP sensorhub ring parser" if !KUNIT_ALL_TESTS
	depends on MTK_SENSORHUB || KUNIT_ALL_TESTS
	default KUNIT_ALL_TESTS
	help
	  Unit tests for the frame parsing of the SCP sensorhub ring, including a
	  corrupted frame. Run with tools/testing/kunit/kunit.py run.
